<title>UK: Jordan Phosphate Mines sets $100 mln 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Jordan Phosphate Mines sets $100 mln 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets (books) and</p>
<p>Arab Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JORDAN PHOSPHATE MINES CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    *  AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +150 BP   PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.75</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	* CALL FROM AUGUST 2000</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JORDAN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSUCURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
